WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

1
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:22.490
Imbere mu nda, umwana utaravuka azengurutswe n'amajwi yoroheje kandi atuje, harimo n'ayabo

2
00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:31.870
umutima wumutima wa mama na sisitemu yumubiri hamwe namajwi n'amajwi avuye kwisi. Nk

3
00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:38.750
gutwita bigeze ku ntera yanyuma, amaso yumwana arashobora gukingura imbere munda. Mugihe badashobora

4
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:46.950
nyamara reba amashusho cyangwa ibisobanuro, birashobora kumva impinduka mumucyo. Rero, mugihe ubuzima bwo munda bwarangiritse

5
00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:56.840
kandi bidahwitse, ni kure yo guceceka. Kubyara nimpinduka nini kubana. Bahita binjira

6
00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:03.820
isi yuzuye ibintu bishya, biboneka neza n'amajwi aranguruye. Guhindura iyi si nshya ni amarangamutima

7
00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:10.340
kubyuka ibyo gutera-gutangira iterambere ryabo. Mu byumweru bike byubuzima, umwana azabikora

8
00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:17.200
gutangara no gukanguka niba hari amajwi aranguruye. Amaso yabo yumva amatara yaka,

9
00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:25.330
ariko barashobora kubona bike cyane. Icyerekezo cyabo, ariko, gitangiye gutera imbere bitangaje

10
00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:33.240
igipimo. Mugihe cibyumweru bibiri, iyerekwa ryateye imbere cyane. Ubu barashobora kubona amakuru arambuye, cyane cyane

11
00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:39.780
niba ibintu biri hafi. Nta bara, kandi ibyo babonye birasa kuko amaso yabo

12
00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:45.880
ntabwo burigihe burigihe kandi bukorera hamwe kubwimbitse. Rimwe na rimwe amaso yabo

13
00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:52.730
Bizagenda cyangwa bisohoka mugihe gito. Ibi byitwa guswera. Ibi bigomba guhagarika kubaho

14
00:01:52.730 --> 00:02:00.340
n'amezi atatu. Ukwezi kumwe, iyerekwa ryamabara ritangiye gutera imbere. Bizaba byinshi

15
00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:06.160
cyane ushishikajwe cyane, cyane cyane mumaso. Bazatangira kandi kugerageza gukurikira ibintu

16
00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:13.030
bigenda. Bazarushaho kumenya amajwi amenyerewe, harimo azwi cyane

17
00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:19.450
amajwi, nkumuryango wabo, hanyuma utangire guhuza ibyo bumva nibyo

18
00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:24.820
reba. Mugihe cyamezi atatu, amaso yabo agomba guhora agororotse kandi agakorera hamwe kurema

19
00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:31.620
Icyerekezo cya 3D. Ubu buryo bushya bwimbitse bubafasha kugera kubintu neza. Bo

20
00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:37.240
azashobora gukurikira ibintu bigenda byihuse. Igihe kimwe, amajwi afite ireme

21
00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:45.420
Bizatangira gukorwa. Mugihe cy'amezi atandatu, umwana agomba kuba ashoboye kumenya abantu bamenyereye

22
00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:50.960
n'amaso yabo yombi n'amajwi yabo. Barashobora kandi gutangira kubona ibintu biri kure

23
00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:57.880
kure. Bitewe namatsiko, bazagera kubintu, barikwegera, kandi, hirya no hino

24
00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:03.760
isabukuru yabo yambere, genda. Ibibondo byabo biratera imbere kandi amajwi azaba abambere

25
00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:13.460
amagambo kuri iki cyiciro kimwe. Mugihe cyamezi 18, iyerekwa ni nkabantu bakuru, nubwo bikiri

26
00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:20.520
bitagaragara. Ubu bazashobora kumenya izina ryabo kandi bakoreshe amagambo menshi kandi menshi.

27
00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:28.300
Abana bamwe ntibashobora kugera kuri izi ntambwe ziterambere mugihe giteganijwe. Hariho

28
00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:34.210
impamvu nyinshi zibitera, kandi benshi bazikosora. Kurugero, abana batagejeje igihe

29
00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:40.920
irashobora gutinda, ariko mubisanzwe ifata nyuma mubana. Kuri bamwe, hashobora kubaho gutsimbarara

30
00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:47.710
ingorane. Kumenya ibi hakiri kare bishoboka gutanga ubuvuzi ninkunga irashobora

31
00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:49.210
iterambere ryinshi.
